usage: agent_gate.py [-h] [--job WORKFLOW#JOB] [--root ROOT] [--log LOG]
                     [--list]

Agent-pipeline gate: run the exact `run:` steps of chosen CI jobs, then
progress.py --check.

options:
  -h, --help          show this help message and exit
  --job WORKFLOW#JOB  CI job whose run-steps form the gate, e.g. ci.yml#host-
                      quality
  --root ROOT         checkout to test (cwd of the steps)
  --log LOG           full log (default: <root>/build/agent-pipeline/gate.log)
  --list              print the resolved steps and exit
